@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@sessionId = replace-with-created-session-id

### Create a terminal session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MAYAN CONSULTING"
}

### Get session status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Poll output events (advance `after` to the last returned sequence number)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions/{{sessionId}}/events?after=0

### Send terminal input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions/{{sessionId}}/input
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "ANGULAR USER"
}

### Activate the terminal after entering a name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions/{{sessionId}}/input
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "INIT"
}

### Connect for live updates with @microsoft/signalr
# Hub URL: {{baseUrl}}/ws/terminal
# Invoke JoinSession(sessionId), then listen for the terminalEvent event.
# Invoke SendInput(sessionId, text) to submit a line over SignalR.

### Delete and stop the session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal-sessions/{{sessionId}}
